[Music]  currently spider-man no way home is  running hot in theaters many will have  already seen it or will see it shortly  and of course the question arises as to  how it will continue in the future on  the one hand a new mcu trilogy around  helmhole and spider-man was announced a  few weeks ago on the other hand there  are many other options one of them is an  appearance in the animated series  spider-man into the spider-verse and  indeed tom recently expressed his  opinion about starring in the so-called  spider-verse together with co-star and  girlfriend zendaya in an interview with  sci-fi wire the two spoke of how they  would both love to appear in spider-man  across the spider-verse and are just  waiting for a call the appearance in the  animated franchise would then only be of  a vocal nature but nevertheless it would  be a logical consequence after the  multiverse has meanwhile found its way  into no way home the new mcu trilogy  will still be particularly interesting  because there is very little information  so far about what it might look like and  especially how the sony universe and the  marvel universe will be integrated  either way we recommend you watch  spiderman no way home which has been in  theaters since friday  rumors about a new mass effect series  have been circulating for a few weeks  now we already reported about the  negotiations between amazon the game  developer bioware and the parent company  electronic arts the witcher star henry  cavill has been considered for this kind  of series since the beginning of the  year at least according to the fanbase  now the 38 year old brit has addressed  the rumors himself for the very first  time in an interview with the game's  raider plus he talked about how he loved  the mass effect games and that the story  would make a fantastic film or series he  also stated that he was very interested  in talking to the people in charge in  fact there was a similar approach with  netflix the witcher series where he  brought himself up for discussion  remaining stubborn until the end and  finally got the deal for the lead role  whether that will work out the same way  again is yet to be seen for now however  we should wait for the negotiations  between amazon and electronic arts  before giving too much thought to the  casting of the individual characters  only recently avatar producer john  landau published a new set photo of  james cameron and sam worthington and  now there is some new material again  during an interview with entertainment  weekly director and creator james  cameron asked himself the question  whether it was still possible to earn  money with such an elaborate production  in fact the shooting is a very unique  challenge which is not least due to  cameron's perfectionist streak  accordingly the 67 year old is a firm  opponent of dry for wet filming which  more or less gives the impression of an  underwater shot despite the scenes being  shot in the drive instead the decision  was made to actually shoot underwater  scenes well  underwater this was often very demanding  for the participating actors for example  a 4 million litre water tank was  purchased for the filming in which the  actors occasionally had to hold their  breath for minutes during the scenes  meanwhile newcomer kate winslet amazed  the team not only with her acting skills  but above all with her underwater record  as cameron confirmed she holds the set  record with seven and a half minutes of  holding her breath  no less exciting other pictures that  were published in the course of this in  addition to behind the scenes  impressions we also get to see a concept  art of the underwater people of the mad  kyina as well as a new type of water  creature with a long neck which  apparently serves as a mound for the  navy all in all an exciting insight from  behind the scenes that definitely makes  us want to see even more avatar 2 will  be released in nearly 1 year on december  16 2022  extraction has been one of the streaming  providers hit since its netflix launch  last year in the meantime it has even  become one of the most successful  netflix movies ever which is why  attention is increasingly turning to the  sequel shooting up extraction 2 was  actually supposed to start in australia  in september but had to be moved to  prague due to several restrictions a  first impression was given on social  media related actor chris hemsworth and  director sam hargrave spoke in good  spirits from a movie train hemsworth not  only announces the start of filming in  this snowy czech republic but also the  fact that his character tyler rake is  still among the living so it is already  clear that we can expect to see a few  changes in the sequel at least the team  behind and in front of the camera seems  to remain the same the russo brothers  who also produced avengers end game are  still mainly in charge the script is  also once again the work of joe russo as  already mentioned we will also see the  main character tyler rake again although  the background officer post demise must  first be clarified after the end of the  first part according to the us magazine  collider extraction 2 is just the  beginning of something much bigger rumor  has it that an entire movie universe is  being created under the direction of  russo's company agbo but for now we're  looking forward to extraction 2 which  will probably celebrate its premiere at  the end of the next year at the earliest  is new animation news from disney as the  company announced on instagram a movie  called strange world is currently in  production disney itself calls it a  journey deep into an uncharted and  treacherous land where fantastical  creatures await more specifically it  will be about a family of explorers  known as clade who are on a quest  through the vast expanse of space to  discover new life similar to raya and  the last dragon the movie is supposed to  be family friendly and humorous but also  dark and serious at times incidentally  behind strange world is none other than  raya and the last dragon creator don  hall who also made the oscar winning  baymax and the animated classic tarzan  screenwriter queen again who likewise  contributed to raya and the last dragon  is also back on board not much more is  known at this point but there is still  some time until the release on november  23rd 2022 anyway  after a long period of silence progress  is being made in the kingsman franchise  with kingsman 3 the film series starring  taran eggerton is to be shot next year  in an interview with comicbook.com  director matthew vaughn revealed that  cameras will start rolling in september  2022 so far it looks like kingsman 3  will be the final installment in the  movie series powering any possible  spin-offs or prequels like the kingsman  the beginning it will be interesting to  see how this story will carry on after  the last spin off kingsman the golden  circle but sadly vonn left us completely  in the dark both in this regard and in  terms of a potential release date as  soon there is new information on this we  will of course let you  know the big reunion of the harry potter  actors on january 1st 2021 on the  occasion of the 20th anniversary of the  sorcerer's stone is approaching in  keeping with the christmas season a few  days ago there was a new poster to  admire which shows the actress in  hogwarts great hall this is a nice  addition to the image published last  week which showed only the main actor  trio pictured here alongside daniel  radcliffe emma watson rupert grint from  left to right are the actors of fred and  george weasley draco malfoy luna  lovegood dean thomas neville longbottom  and ginny weasley we are definitely  looking forward to the reunion and are  eagerly anticipating january 1st 2022  when harry potter returned to hogwarts  will be shown on hbo max  [Music]  well this is all the news we have for  you this week if you like this video  please leave a like and subscribe to us  so you don't miss anything and be sure  to check out the new trailer for  fantastic beasts the secrets of  dumbledore as well as the second trailer  for the banana lovers namely  minions the rise of grow  [Music]

